      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The Bangladeshi garment industry wage board agrees to raise minimum wages after five days of protests, where workers demanded ৳30,000 (US$240) a month, up from ৳12,500 (US$100).",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "The 2026 Southeast Asian haze, an air pollution event, has affected Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Thailand, Timor Leste, and Singapore since August 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384072344:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Formula One (F1) races in Sepang and Singapore held in October 2026 were affected by the haze.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384072344:107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On the map, the haze is centred on Singapore and Malaysia, where the reports place it.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The event began in 2026, in Southeast Asia.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q141274248:P580",
        "wd:Q141274248:P276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "Southeast Asia is also named in the reports.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-04:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:52Z",
